  "description": "Create and process Factur-X (ZUGFeRD) and XRechnung invoices in .NET applications.\n\nFactoorSharp.FacturX is a .NET library for creating and processing Factur-X (ZUGFeRD) and XRechnung documents. It is the successor to the ZUGFeRD-csharp library. The package provides a business-level invoice model and functionality to generate, read, and transform structured electronic invoice data. Use this package when working with Factur-X (ZUGFeRD) and XRechnung independently of PDF handling. PDF/A-3 support is available in the companion package FactoorSharp.FacturX.PDF.",
